Grayswandir is considered by many to be the best general-purpose
weapon in the game.  I rarely use Mjollnir, it has a nasty habit of
destroying wands/rings and the scariest of the endgame nasties are
shock resistant.

FWIW: My valkyries don't bother getting Mjollnir (on purpose).

To answer your specific question (I ignored strength bonuses here):

Grayswandir: (ench + d8)x2 + skill + str + (d20 silver (sometimes))
Mjollnir:    (ench + d4+1) + skill + str (d24 electric (sometimes))

                    SAVG   LAVG
+7 Grayswandir [b] 33.50  33.50 <- silver in effect
+7 Grayswandir [b] 23.00  23.00
+7 Mjollnir    [E] 25.00  24.00
+7 Mjollnir    [E] 12.50  11.50 <- shock resistant nasty

